{
  "post": {
    "id": "1535165",
    "published": "2015-11-19T05:00:07.000Z",
    "title": "はじめましてのご挨拶",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1535165.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20151127175031/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1535165.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "153dfd190839.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/2/e/2e35f488.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "はじめまして、鹿乃ですヽ|･ω･|ゞ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "初次见面，我是鹿乃ヽ|･ω･|ゞ"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Nice to meet you, I'm Kano ヽ|･ω･|ゞ"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "読み方は「カノ」です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "名字读作“Kano”。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's read \"Kano\"."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "歌をうたっています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我是唱歌的。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I sing songs."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "よろしくお願いしますっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "请多多关照！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pleased to meet you!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日、11月18日に私の2ndシングル「ディアブレイブ」がリリースされました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天，11月18日，我的第二张单曲《Dear Brave》发售了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday, November 18, my 2nd single \"Dear brave\" was released."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こちらの表題曲はTVアニメ「ヘヴィーオブジェクト」のED主題歌になっています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这张单曲的主打歌，是电视动画《重装武器》的片尾主题曲。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The title track is the ending theme for the TV anime \"Heavy Object\"."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アニメともどもご愛顧いただきますようなにとぞなにとぞ…！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "希望大家连同动画一起多多支持它，拜托了拜托了……！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please support both the anime and the song, I'm begging you, I'm begging you...!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ちなみに余談ですが、このブログを書きながらワーナーさんの社内を彷徨い歩いています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "顺便说个题外话，我现在正一边写这篇博客，一边在华纳的办公楼里晃来晃去。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By the way, as a side note, I'm writing this blog while wandering around inside the Warner offices."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "誰か迎えに…迎えに…"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "谁来接我一下……谁来接我……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Somebody come get me... come get me..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "初次见面的问候",
    "titleEn": "Nice to Meet You!"
  },
